<table width="700" border="0" align="left" valig="top" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">    <td width="560" background="barre.jpg"><span class="GTitre">To be continued</span><br> </td>    <td width="140" background="barre.jpg" class="date"><div align="right">01/11/2003</div></td>  </tr>  <tr>     <td bgcolor="#2F2828" colspan="2"><p><br>        <span class="normal"><p><strong><u>HAPPY HALLOWEEN</u></strong></p><br />
<p align="center"> <img src="http://www.mtsguild.com/news_pics/halloween.jpg" width="640" height="480"><br><br />
<p><strong><u>Plan of Air</u></strong></p><br />
<p>In typical MTS style we paid another visit to PoA we flew like the Wind to Avatar 1, Smoked Avatar 2 and who would have Mist Avatar 3? We will be back for the fourth!</p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_011103c.jpg" width="640" height="300"><br><img src="news_pics/news_011103b.jpg" width="640" height="150"></p><br />
<p align="left"><strong><u>Plan of Earth</u></strong></p><br />
<p>'Come on Uggie' pleaded his friends 'lets go to the Plane of Earth for sone fun?'. The big ogre peaked over his blanket 'fun?' he asked. 'Aye, we get to play in the mud' his friends lied. 'But wat about da big bad golems who play in da mud? they eat us!' MTS started packing Uggies gear, this was starting to become a ritual when Uggie had to face anything that was bigger than him he would feign illness and go to bed hoping his 'friends' would forget about him, they never did though. 'Uggie you do know those things you call golems are just ogres covered in mud don't you?' someone proclaimed. Over the sniggering the ogre sighed 'Well guys if you say so' Uggie shrugged and dropped the blanket, females fainted. <br />
<br><br />
So the story unfolded and MTS travelled to PoE dragging the ogre, those golems weren't so tough when you knew they were just bad mud covered ogres. Golems died and named spawned and promptly died, good loot was had by lots, grats all. People enjoyed themselves so much they have promised to return</p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_011103e.jpg" width="640" height="150"><br><img src="news_pics/news_011103a.jpg" width="640" height="300"></p><br />
<p><strong><u>NEW FULL MEMBERS</u></strong></p><br />
<p>Just like to say a huge welcome to the radioactive gnome Beyond and the ranger with the unfortunate itch Ramaril, welcome to MTS guys. </p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="http://www.mtsguild.com/images/recruit/beyond.jpg" width="300" height="250"><img src="http://www.mtsguild.com/images/recruit/ramaril.jpg" width="300" height="250"></p><br />
<p align="left">Have a nice day !</p></span><span class="normal"><br>        </span></p>      </td>  </tr>  <tr background="barre1.jpg">     <td background="barre1.jpg">&nbsp;</td>    <td background="barre1.jpg"class="auteur">Saradoc / Uggie</td>  </tr>  <tr><td colspan="2"><br></td></tr>    <td width="560" background="barre.jpg"><span class="GTitre">Elemental Plans... ACTION !</span><br> </td>    <td width="140" background="barre.jpg" class="date"><div align="right">25/10/2003</div></td>  </tr>  <tr>     <td bgcolor="#2F2828" colspan="2"><p><br>        <span class="normal"><p><strong><u>ONCE UPON A TIME...</u></strong></p><br />
<p>MTS continues his progression on EPs, we had a lot of fun (and pain) discovering new creatures, new environments and of course new drops. Succes on some, Wipe on others, all together makes it fun. <br />
Pyronis, Hydrotha, Magmaton, Avatar of Air, Avatar of Smoke... We have also finish some flags for our members, hoping soon that every MTS can acces to these lands without a raid. <br />
</p><br />
<p align="center"> <img src="news_pics/news_251003b.jpg" width="640" height="150"><br><img src="news_pics/news_251003c.jpg" width="640" height="300"><br><img src="news_pics/news_251003d.jpg" width="640" height="150"></p><br />
<p align="center">After swimming, floating and burning... Let's have a look at Earth stuff. We killed some nasty mobs, and the big handbag. No doubt we ll be back for some more kills. </p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_251003e.jpg" width="640" height="150"><br><img src="news_pics/news_251003g.jpg" width="640" height="150"><br><img src="news_pics/news_251003h.jpg" width="640" height="245"></p><br />
<p align="left"><strong><u>The 'NO COMMENT' Picture</u></strong></p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_251003f.jpg" width="640" height="300"></p><br />
<p align="left"><strong><u>NEW FULL MEMBERS</u></strong></p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="images/recruit/agravain.jpg" width="320" height="250"><img src="images/recruit/bixer.jpg" width="320" height="250"><br><center><img src="images/recruit/gimpy.jpg" width="320" height="250"></center></p><br />
<p align="left"><strong><u>RECRUITMENT</u></strong></p><br />
<p align="center"><a href="mailto:Strych-Nin@gmx.de"><img src="news_pics/wanted1.jpg" width="640" height="300"></a></p><br />
<p align="left">Have a nice day !</p></span><span class="normal"><br>        </span></p>      </td>  </tr>  <tr background="barre1.jpg">     <td background="barre1.jpg">&nbsp;</td>    <td background="barre1.jpg"class="auteur">Saradoc</td>  </tr>  <tr><td colspan="2"><br></td></tr>    <td width="560" background="barre.jpg"><span class="GTitre">Reflagging is good for ya !</span><br> </td>    <td width="140" background="barre.jpg" class="date"><div align="right">19/10/2003</div></td>  </tr>  <tr>     <td bgcolor="#2F2828" colspan="2"><p><br>        <span class="normal"><p><strong>KNOCK KNOCK !</strong></p><br />
<p>After the first kills it comes the time for reflagging.<br />
It's with a lot of joy that we meet again our old friends Rallos Zek & Family, Solusek Ro, Trials of Mithaniel Marr... I must say that we have a true relationship with some of them, we try to always keep contact with them, and I think they are happy to see us. <br />
</p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_151003a.jpg" width="640" height="150"></p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/RallosZek.jpg" width="640" height="512"></p><br />
<p>It is also time for us to seek new friends in the Reef of Coirnav and in Eryslai the Kingdom of Wind. They were very friendly with us and we promised them we would visit again. We learnt that some of them are more susceptible than our previous friends (before starting a discussion about sushis, be aware with who you are talking). </p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_151003b.jpg" width="640" height="245"></p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_151003c.jpg" width="640" height="245"></p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_151003d.jpg" width="640" height="245"></p><br />
<p align="left">We also visited one of the sexiest woman in The World of Norrath : Aten Ha Ra, in fact twice! I think she fell in love with one of our members but I can't tell that it's Gansacco, otherwise she will be mad at me. And I really don't want to hurt her feelings, hobbits are really sensitive to 'hurting feelings' (specialy when this person has 4 arms).</p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_151003e.jpg" width="638" height="150"></p><br />
<p align="left"><strong>HE IS BACK !!</strong></p><br />
<p align="left">Last but not least! You can stop asking for after 'him', his come back was announced many times, but nobody really knew... <br />
Every single day Bristlebane does, we receive toons of emails, letters, pictures, presents and candies. I can now tell you officialy, that ... he is back !!</p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_151003f.jpg" width="640" height="440"></p><br />
<p align="left">Have a nice day !</p></span><span class="normal"><br>        </span></p>      </td>  </tr>  <tr background="barre1.jpg">     <td background="barre1.jpg">&nbsp;</td>    <td background="barre1.jpg"class="auteur">Saradoc / Uggie</td>  </tr>  <tr><td colspan="2"><br></td></tr> <tr>
